{
  "font_size": 0.4,
  "font_color": "#FFFFFF",
  "background_alpha": 0.5,
  "background_color": "#9C27B0",
  "Stroke": "none",
  "type": "AIsubtitle",
  "lang": "en",
  "version": "v1.7.0.4",
  "body": [
    {
      "from": 0.04,
      "to": 2.84,
      "sid": 1,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "A deserted town on Route 66 in the United States",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 2.84,
      "to": 3.62,
      "sid": 2,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Glenrio",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 3.62,
      "to": 6.22,
      "sid": 3,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It's located at the border between Texas and New Mexico",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 6.22,
      "to": 7.96,
      "sid": 4,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The current population here is zero",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 7.96,
      "to": 10.24,
      "sid": 5,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It's perfect for someone like me to come for a walk at night",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 10.24,
      "to": 13.07,
      "sid": 6,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Back in the day, there were many businesses serving travelers on the highway",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 13.07,
      "to": 14.69,
      "sid": 7,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Like the auto repair shop I just passed",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 14.69,
      "to": 17.44,
      "sid": 8,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And this little diner combined with a motel in front of me",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 17.44,
      "to": 19.4,
      "sid": 9,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This room looks just like the cliffside ones I love to stay in",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 19.4,
      "to": 20.68,
      "sid": 10,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The motel is pretty much the same.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 20.68,
      "to": 22.2,
      "sid": 11,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "There are quite a few rooms.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 22.2,
      "to": 23.57,
      "sid": 12,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Let's drive around and take a look.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 23.57,
      "to": 25.61,
      "sid": 13,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It was quite well-known back then.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 25.61,
      "to": 27.89,
      "sid": 14,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This hotel is located on the state line in Texas.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 27.89,
      "to": 29.93,
      "sid": 15,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Back then, if people were traveling via Route 66,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 29.93,
      "to": 31.91,
      "sid": 16,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "entering Texas from New Mexico,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 31.91,
      "to": 34.25,
      "sid": 17,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "this would be the first hotel they could choose in Texas.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 34.25,
      "to": 35.23,
      "sid": 18,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "If you're going in the opposite direction,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 35.23,
      "to": 37.45,
      "sid": 19,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "They are the last inn standing within the borders of Texas.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 37.45,
      "to": 40.36,
      "sid": 20,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "That's why their sign reads 'First and Last in Texas'.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 40.36,
      "to": 42.04,
      "sid": 21,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Although the surrounding area is now wilderness,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 42.04,
      "to": 43.94,
      "sid": 22,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the sign has been preserved.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 43.94,
      "to": 46.31,
      "sid": 23,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Even though only a few letters remain.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 46.31,
      "to": 48.27,
      "sid": 24,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Turning west in the darkness,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 48.27,
      "to": 50.55,
      "sid": 25,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "you'll find Glorieta, on the New Mexico side.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 50.55,
      "to": 51.99,
      "sid": 26,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The only green light in sight,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 51.99,
      "to": 54.53,
      "sid": 27,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "is a new business in the abandoned town.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 54.53,
      "to": 57.27,
      "sid": 28,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This is the American specialty herb store right in front of me.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 57.27,
      "to": 58.99,
      "sid": 29,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "However, it only operates until seven in the evening.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 58.99,
      "to": 59.89,
      "sid": 30,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Check the live map.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 59.89,
      "to": 61.36,
      "sid": 31,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "There are still some people around during the day.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 61.36,
      "to": 62.32,
      "sid": 32,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "New Mexico",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 62.32,
      "to": 64.6,
      "sid": 33,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "legalized cannabis in 2021.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 64.6,
      "to": 66.59,
      "sid": 34,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But the regulations in Texas remain strict.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 66.59,
      "to": 68.39,
      "sid": 35,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "A new store has opened online as well.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 68.39,
      "to": 70.199,
      "sid": 36,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It’s also convenient for the people of Texas.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 70.199,
      "to": 71.999,
      "sid": 37,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It's actually very similar to history",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 71.999,
      "to": 74.959,
      "sid": 38,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "All the liquor stores were on the New Mexico side back then",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 74.959,
      "to": 77.659,
      "sid": 39,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Because all the Texas counties bordering New Mexico",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 77.659,
      "to": 78.83,
      "sid": 40,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "were dry",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 78.83,
      "to": 81.07,
      "sid": 41,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "While other businesses like gas stations and restaurants",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 81.07,
      "to": 82.59,
      "sid": 42,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "were on the Texas side",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 82.59,
      "to": 84.63,
      "sid": 43,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "due to lower taxes in Texas",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 84.63,
      "to": 86.35,
      "sid": 44,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Beyond the ruins of the old post office",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 86.35,
      "to": 89.47,
      "sid": 45,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "lies the vast wilderness of New Mexico",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 89.47,
      "to": 91.55,
      "sid": 46,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Apart from the old Route 66 in the town area",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 91.55,
      "to": 92.93,
      "sid": 47,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "it is in a completely abandoned state",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 92.93,
      "to": 94.69,
      "sid": 48,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "full of potholes and small stones",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 94.69,
      "to": 97.33,
      "sid": 49,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "a car like mine can't drive on it at all",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 97.33,
      "to": 100.6,
      "sid": 50,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "while the road conditions within the former Glenrio town limits were still quite decent",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 100.6,
      "to": 102.48,
      "sid": 51,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and there wasn't a soul around at night",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 102.48,
      "to": 105.24,
      "sid": 52,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I felt like I could do whatever I wanted here",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 105.24,
      "to": 108.13,
      "sid": 53,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "so I let loose a bit on the road",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 108.13,
      "to": 110.41,
      "sid": 54,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "after all, it didn’t look like there were any police around",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 110.41,
      "to": 113.43,
      "sid": 55,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "However, the road ahead becomes a dead end after just over 2km.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 113.43,
      "to": 115.19,
      "sid": 56,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The Texas segment of Route 66",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 115.19,
      "to": 116.11,
      "sid": 57,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "in the 1970s",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 116.11,
      "to": 118.49,
      "sid": 58,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "was upgraded to a closed interstate highway.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 118.49,
      "to": 120.55,
      "sid": 59,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Only this small section near New Mexico",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 120.55,
      "to": 121.84,
      "sid": 60,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "has been preserved.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 121.84,
      "to": 123.04,
      "sid": 61,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "In practice,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 123.04,
      "to": 125.4,
      "sid": 62,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "to force entry into a closed interstate highway from the outside,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 125.4,
      "to": 127.009,
      "sid": 63,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "you just need to get over this small hill.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 127.009,
      "to": 129.129,
      "sid": 64,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But I, being law-abiding, still stand on the highway.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 129.129,
      "to": 131.969,
      "sid": 65,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Listen to the roaring sound of the heat waves from passing vehicles.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 135.94,
      "to": 138.02,
      "sid": 66,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "On the highway bridge less than a kilometer from the town,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 138.02,
      "to": 140.269,
      "sid": 67,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "you can also see the Interstate 40 below.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 140.269,
      "to": 141.669,
      "sid": 68,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This fully enclosed road,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 141.669,
      "to": 142.889,
      "sid": 69,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "while it has increased efficiency,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 142.889,
      "to": 146.029,
      "sid": 70,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "also means that the highway must bypass the villages along the way.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 146.029,
      "to": 148.529,
      "sid": 71,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Travelers no longer stop to spend money as they used to.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 148.529,
      "to": 151.7,
      "sid": 72,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Now, many such towns have only a few hundred residents left.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 151.7,
      "to": 152.9,
      "sid": 73,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Glorieta is completely deserted",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 152.9,
      "to": 154.66,
      "sid": 74,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "mainly because within a 60km radius",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 154.66,
      "to": 156.36,
      "sid": 75,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "there isn't a single town with over a thousand residents",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 156.36,
      "to": 157.1,
      "sid": 76,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "staying here",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 157.1,
      "to": 158.0,
      "sid": 77,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "is extremely inconvenient",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 158.0,
      "to": 159.34,
      "sid": 78,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "now leaving Glorieta",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 159.34,
      "to": 160.16,
      "sid": 79,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "let me show you",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 160.16,
      "to": 161.08,
      "sid": 80,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "a 20-minute drive away",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 161.08,
      "to": 164.06,
      "sid": 81,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the small town of San Jon in New Mexico, which still has 195 residents",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 164.06,
      "to": 166.78,
      "sid": 82,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This unmanned highway exit is perfect for long-distance drives.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 166.78,
      "to": 167.8,
      "sid": 83,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "You can pull over and take a nap.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 167.8,
      "to": 169.64,
      "sid": 84,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "There’s a car parked on the right for a rest.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 169.64,
      "to": 172.7,
      "sid": 85,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The yellow sign ahead says 'Welcome to New Mexico'.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 172.7,
      "to": 175.06,
      "sid": 86,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "As soon as you enter New Mexico, there’s a small rest area.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 175.06,
      "to": 176.42,
      "sid": 87,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Many trucks are parked here.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 176.42,
      "to": 178.0,
      "sid": 88,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I’ll take the opportunity to check my phone.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 178.0,
      "to": 178.8,
      "sid": 89,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I was back in China recently.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 178.8,
      "to": 181.2,
      "sid": 90,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I bought this 95% new iPhone 14 on OfferUp.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 181.2,
      "to": 181.68,
      "sid": 91,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Pro max",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 181.68,
